            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You'll need a kiln. Use the Flame Kiln in Emil Flamewright's ring shop, in the Atheneum in Dragonspyre. Only the flame of Dragonspyre can melt Everfrost Ice Fragments into the Pure Loam.",
